Loose socks and streaks aren't
allowed at this school.

00:11:30.356 --> 00:11:31.433
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:11:31.457 --> 00:11:32.300
What? Oh, yeah.
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:11:32.324 --> 00:11:33.917
What? Oh, yeah.

00:11:35.027 --> 00:11:36.905
Hey, Kotobuki.

00:11:36.929 --> 00:11:39.408
No, hey, let go of me.

00:11:39.432 --> 00:11:41.209
Not until you say you'll go out with me.

00:11:41.233 --> 00:11:42.911
You're pushing it.

00:11:42.935 --> 00:11:44.479
It's for your own good.

00:11:44.503 --> 00:11:46.835
| love you so much.

00:11:47.807 --> 00:11:49.468
Enough is...

00:11:49.775 --> 00:11:50.970
Shoot!

00:11:51.911 --> 00:11:53.675
So, I'm telling you, Kotobuki...

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:54.956
Stop!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.558
Don't be rash, Kotobuki!
Stop!

00:11:56.582 --> 00:11:57.447
Don't be rash, Kotobuki!

00:12:02.121 --> 00:12:04.666
Who the hell are you?!
What do you want with Miyu?!

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:07.352
Ow! That's none of your business!

00:12:07.927 --> 00:12:10.706
Ran, he's the one. That K.Y. guy.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.475
What're you trying to pull, sending
weird letters to Miyu?!

00:12:13.499 --> 00:12:15.467
Miyu's already got a man!

00:12:17.303 --> 00:12:19.214
If you got that, then beat it!

00:12:19.238 --> 00:12:22.640
You do anything to Miyu
and I'll kick your butt!

00:12:24.176 --> 00:12:26.855
That look in his eyes wasn't normal.

00:12:26.879 --> 00:12:28.523
Try not to be by yourself too much.

00:12:28.547 --> 00:12:30.379
Okay, I understand.

00:12:30.783 --> 00:12:32.751
Ran...

00:12:33.719 --> 00:12:35.597
Thank you.

00:12:35.621 --> 00:12:37.799
No problem. We're friends, aren't we?

00:12:37.823 --> 00:12:37.899
Hey, Kotobuki!

00:12:37.923 --> 00:12:39.501
Hey, Kotobuki!
Hey, Kotobuki!

00:12:39.525 --> 00:12:39.616
Hey, Kotobuki!

00:12:40.693 --> 00:12:42.370
We're not done talking yet!

00:12:42.394 --> 00:12:44.362
Whoa, Naka Teach, watch out!

00:12:46.966 --> 00:12:48.910
Ko-to-bu-ki...

00:12:48.934 --> 00:12:49.111
He's alive?!
Ko-to-bu-ki...

00:12:49.135 --> 00:12:49.377
He's alive?!
Stop right there! Hey!

00:12:49.401 --> 00:12:50.712
Stop right there! Hey!

00:12:50.736 --> 00:12:53.215
Kotobuki, you are always so...

00:12:53.239 --> 00:12:55.435
What do you take your teacher for?!

00:12:57.243 --> 00:12:59.678
Miss Yamazaki has a boyfriend?

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:09.364
What?!

00:13:09.388 --> 00:13:11.880
Miyu's being hounded
by some weird guy?!

00:13:12.591 --> 00:13:15.370
| wasn't sure if I should
tell you this or not.

00:13:15.394 --> 00:13:17.556
He's the type that gets obsessive.

00:13:17.963 --> 00:13:20.375
It might be dangerous for her
even to be home alone.

00:13:20.399 --> 00:13:22.367
Why didn't you bring her here?!

00:13:22.802 --> 00:13:24.379
Don't you get it?!

00:13:24.403 --> 00:13:26.815
Miyu doesn't want to get you involved!

00:13:26.839 --> 00:13:30.673
I'm a police officer! My job is to
protect people from danger!

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:33.722
That's why I said you don't
get it, you moron!

00:13:33.746 --> 00:13:34.289
Excuse me, could I get some directions for...

00:13:34.313 --> 00:13:35.290
What did you say?!
Excuse me, could I get some directions for...

00:13:35.314 --> 00:13:36.258
How dare you call your brother a moron!
Excuse me, could I get some directions for...

00:13:36.282 --> 00:13:37.592
How dare you call your brother a moron!

00:13:37.616 --> 00:13:40.449
Are you going out with Miyu
as a police officer?

00:13:42.788 --> 00:13:44.533
That's not how Miyu sees it.

00:13:44.557 --> 00:13:46.568
She's in love with the man
that's in you.

00:13:46.592 --> 00:13:49.104
Well, of course, I...

00:13:49.128 --> 00:13:52.140
You big idiot! You're saying it
to the wrong person!

00:13:52.164 --> 00:13:53.308
Excuse me...

00:13:53.332 --> 00:13:56.311
Women are creatures that
can't be reassured,

00:13:56.335 --> 00:13:58.814
unless they hear the words.

00:13:58.838 --> 00:14:01.330
How I feel about Miyu...

00:14:01.774 --> 00:14:05.677
If you still don't get it, then
you're an ultra-idiot!

00:14:08.614 --> 00:14:11.584
Excuse me... Hello...

00:14:20.226 --> 00:14:23.252
Then, here are twenty questions
for you, Otohata.

00:14:23.729 --> 00:14:25.106
When is your birthday?

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.723
March 6th.

00:14:27.299 --> 00:14:29.411
Blood type?

00:14:29.435 --> 00:14:30.925
B.

00:14:31.337 --> 00:14:32.480
Height?

00:14:32.504 --> 00:14:34.316
180.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:35.584
Weight?

00:14:35.608 --> 00:14:37.576
59.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:41.556
You know, I always get asked this.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:43.291
You can find the answers if you
look at other magazines.

00:14:43.315 --> 00:14:45.360
Oh, come on, just answer
them for her.

00:14:45.384 --> 00:14:47.910
Right, right. This is an interview, after all.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:50.098
By the way,

00:14:50.122 --> 00:14:54.236
might those girls be your girlfriends?

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:58.640
Oh, no. She's in a bit of bad
situation right now,

00:14:58.664 --> 00:15:01.009
so we've been asked to act
as her bodyguards.

00:15:01.033 --> 00:15:03.245
So, no photos, okay?

00:15:03.269 --> 00:15:04.964
Miyu will be fine, you know.

00:15:05.404 --> 00:15:06.848
It's okay, it's okay.

00:15:06.872 --> 00:15:10.585
There's no way |, Yuya Asou, would
turn down a request from Ran.

00:15:10.609 --> 00:15:12.976
Maybe I should get a red streak after all.

00:15:17.182 --> 00:15:19.150
Ran's such a worrier.

00:15:19.618 --> 00:15:21.263
That's what's so great about her.

00:15:21.287 --> 00:15:23.231
All right, then.

00:15:23.255 --> 00:15:25.033
Your favorite food?

00:15:25.057 --> 00:15:26.668
No particular preferences.

00:15:26.692 --> 00:15:28.937
What is your image of an ideal girl?

00:15:28.961 --> 00:15:31.020
| don't really have one.

00:15:31.563 --> 00:15:33.964
Then, how about types
that you don't like?

00:15:35.034 --> 00:15:37.025
Like this.

00:15:41.273 --> 00:15:42.350
Hi there!

00:15:42.374 --> 00:15:43.618
