00:16:05.764 --> 00:16:07.858
Okay, Miyu, Aya, let's go.

00:16:08.834 --> 00:16:11.246
Oh, wait! I'm coming too!

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.281
Aren't you getting interviewed too,
Second Place?

00:16:13.305 --> 00:16:15.183
I'm done already.

00:16:15.207 --> 00:16:17.819
You keep dragging us all over the place.

00:16:17.843 --> 00:16:19.311
Why don't you stay?

00:16:20.212 --> 00:16:22.180
It's okay, I don't mind.

00:16:22.614 --> 00:16:24.173
I'll take you home.

00:16:25.451 --> 00:16:27.529
But...

00:16:27.553 --> 00:16:30.398
Oh, that sounds good! Otohata,
I'm counting on you.

00:16:30.422 --> 00:16:31.933
Oh, wait, Ran!

00:16:31.957 --> 00:16:33.925
Buh-bye!

00:16:36.862 --> 00:16:39.107
Then, thank you in advance.

00:16:39.131 --> 00:16:41.676
Yes, Ma'am. So, what's next?

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:43.945
Oh, right, let's see...

00:16:43.969 --> 00:16:45.780
What kind of club activities do you do?

00:16:45.804 --> 00:16:47.782
Go Home Club.

00:16:47.806 --> 00:16:49.718
Your favorite accessories?

00:16:49.742 --> 00:16:51.710
What I'm wearing right now.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.174
