00:17:05.157 --> 00:17:07.769
Hey, Ran, you wanna eat something? My treat.

00:17:07.793 --> 00:17:08.670
For real?!

00:17:08.694 --> 00:17:10.805
Yeah, I just got paid, so...

00:17:10.829 --> 00:17:13.141
All right! Let's go on a Shibuya binge!

00:17:13.165 --> 00:17:15.143
That's a bit...

00:17:15.167 --> 00:17:17.045
Miyu's not very hungry.

00:17:17.069 --> 00:17:19.333
You can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:17:19.805 --> 00:17:21.500
Fight?

00:17:26.612 --> 00:17:27.722
Yoshida!

00:17:27.746 --> 00:17:30.408
Are you the guy that stole away my Miyu?!

00:17:31.483 --> 00:17:34.714
His Miyu? What's he talking about?

00:17:35.587 --> 00:17:37.032
Is this the...

00:17:37.056 --> 00:17:40.390
What do you want? I told you
to leave her alone, didn't 1?

00:17:41.293 --> 00:17:43.638
What the heck are you thinking?!

00:17:43.662 --> 00:17:45.630
Yoshida, don't do anything stupid.

00:17:46.432 --> 00:17:48.410
It's your fault!

00:17:48.434 --> 00:17:50.596
It's because you stole Miyu from me!

00:17:52.438 --> 00:17:56.017
I'll get rid of anyone who comes
between Miyu and me!

00:17:56.041 --> 00:17:58.253
Miyu, you stay back.

00:17:58.277 --> 00:18:00.288
There's no reason for you
to risk yourself.

00:18:00.312 --> 00:18:01.656
Miyu will settle this.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.358
Never mind, just leave it to me!

00:18:03.382 --> 00:18:06.044
Even I can't handle you when you flip crazy.

00:18:06.518 --> 00:18:07.996
That's mean!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.852
Flip Crazy = Flip Out Like Crazy

00:18:11.256 --> 00:18:12.917
Ran...

00:18:13.992 --> 00:18:15.537
Hey, Yoshida.

00:18:15.561 --> 00:18:18.826
You're getting all cocky just
because we've been quiet.

00:18:19.631 --> 00:18:21.576
You wanna get smacked
around for real?

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.001
Shut up! You piss me off too!

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:27.064
It'll be for Miyu's own good
to go out with me!

00:18:31.844 --> 00:18:33.710
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:37.049 --> 00:18:39.313
Damn it, you piss me off.

00:18:39.685 --> 00:18:42.263
Nothing will go the way I want it to.

00:18:42.287 --> 00:18:43.865
Shut your trap!

00:18:43.889 --> 00:18:46.468
Just like how you have feelings
and you get pissed,

00:18:46.492 --> 00:18:49.104
Miyu has feelings too!

00:18:49.128 --> 00:18:52.462
In this world, it's normal for things
not to go your way!

00:18:52.831 --> 00:18:56.144
Don't force your thoughts and
feelings onto other people!

00:18:56.168 --> 00:18:58.933
Sometimes, bowing out
is part of being a man.

00:18:59.404 --> 00:19:00.997
Yoshida...

00:19:02.174 --> 00:19:04.973
I'm not the kind of girl
that you think I am.

00:19:06.078 --> 00:19:09.514
In junior high, I was hopelessly
out of control.

00:19:10.415 --> 00:19:13.595
| used to be a gang leader.

00:19:13.619 --> 00:19:16.350
And I used to do everything from
stealing to blackmailing.

00:19:16.889 --> 00:19:18.466
There was even a time

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:21.323
