| want to protect you.

00:20:31.196 --> 00:20:33.675
I'm sorry for making you feel insecure.

00:20:33.699 --> 00:20:36.691
No, Yamato...

00:20:37.703 --> 00:20:40.014
Miyu's sorry for being spoiled too!

00:20:40.038 --> 00:20:44.452
| know I'll be happy just by
you being there for me.

00:20:44.476 --> 00:20:47.188
I'll listen to what you say from now on.

00:20:47.212 --> 00:20:49.424
<i>I'm sorry, 'm sorry.</i>

00:20:49.448 --> 00:20:51.041
Miyu...

00:20:54.519 --> 00:20:55.663
What about a smooch now?

00:20:55.687 --> 00:20:56.097
What?! Well...
