00:21:50.042 --> 00:21:52.186
Wow, you're so lucky!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:53.154
Whoa, talk about goosebumps!

00:21:53.178 --> 00:21:53.921
| envy you, Miyu.
Whoa, talk about goosebumps!

00:21:53.945 --> 00:21:54.589
| envy you, Miyu.

00:21:54.613 --> 00:21:56.457
Isn't there anyone you like, Aya?

00:21:56.481 --> 00:21:59.712
Someone I like?

00:22:03.388 --> 00:22:05.867
The gals of Shibuya are invincible!

00:22:05.891 --> 00:22:08.069
